WEBVTT

00:03.000 --> 00:05.200
Skye, look! The water is glowing!

00:10.900 --> 00:11.500
Mila!

00:33.500 --> 00:35.600
Where... am I?

00:42.850 --> 00:46.100
My friend. Yellow jacket. Where is she?

00:46.500 --> 00:52.400
She is safe. Visitors cannot enter this wing. Unregistered visitors are held,

00:52.450 --> 00:54.900
and their memory of this place is sealed.

01:07.600 --> 01:08.650
She is with me.

01:09.450 --> 01:10.650
My future bride.
